# Density Compare
# Dubnium (Db) — real density 29.3 g/cm³. equal masses: Dubnium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Dubnium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 6.5mm color: #60c0ff at (-20mm, 3.2mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 233.7 g — the water cube is the reference
